", "id": "1381754954088106", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623131_1381754957421439_8423269832479797083_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LLbjIS4miQoQ7kNvwFFHeKo&_nc_oc=AdoIBfucw7iQBF9dmPwUSQtDFcYMqwkiVCkZFFMkoJxSWfE_TAkkAvGHgaTH7S6luMM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQU5vXKW6iCFog942rn_EEtmf2hnSX-MATwrBQH1s3xFg&oe=6AFC8AB7"}, "display_name": "MY ROOM", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The room features various elements designed to offer unique VR experiences. Please give them a try, using the provided guidelines and gameplay tips memo on the desk in the room.\n\nYou can enjoy a variety of experiences, such as: sports activities, watching TV, growing plants, light the candle, trying on hats, lighting effects, and spatial audio,and more.", "short_description": "The room features various elements designed to offer unique VR experiences. Please give them a try, using the provided UI guidelines and gameplay tips memo on the desk in the room."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "915880854648630", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MEIN ZIMMER", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Der Raum bietet verschiedene Elemente, die f\u00fcr einzigartige VR-Erlebnisse konzipiert wurden. Probieren Sie diese gerne aus \u2013 nutzen Sie dazu die bereitgestellten Hinweise und das Merkblatt mit Gameplay-Tipps, das auf dem Schreibtisch im Raum liegt.\n\nEs erwartet Sie eine Vielzahl von Erlebnissen, darunter sportliche Aktivit\u00e4ten, Fernsehen, Pflanzenzucht, Kerzenanz\u00fcnden, das Anprobieren von H\u00fcten, Lichteffekte, Spatial Audio und vieles mehr.", "short_description": "Der Raum bietet verschiedene Elemente, die f\u00fcr einzigartige VR-Erlebnisse konzipiert wurden. Probieren Sie diese gerne aus \u2013 nutzen Sie dazu die bereitgestellten Hinweise und das Merkblatt mit Gameplay-Tipps, das auf dem Schreibtisch im Raum liegt."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "860724887035457", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MY ROOM", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u3053\u306e\u90e8\u5c4b\u306b\u306f\u3001\u30e6\u30cb\u30fc\u30af\u306aVR\u4f53\u9a13\u3092\u697d\u3057\u3081\u308b\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u4ed5\u639b\u3051\u304c\u7528\u610f\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5ba4\u5185\u306e\u30c7\u30b9\u30af\u306b\u7f6e\u304b\u308c\u305f\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3084\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u53c2\u8003\u306b\u3001\u305c\u3072\u4f53\u9a13\u3057\u3066\u307f\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n\n\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c4\u3001\u30c6\u30ec\u30d3\u9451\u8cde\u3001\u690d\u7269\u306e\u80b2\u6210\u3001\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30c9\u30eb\u3078\u306e\u70b9\u706b\u3001\u5e3d\u5b50\u306e\u8a66\u7740\u3001\u7167\u660e\u6f14\u51fa\u3001\u7a7a\u9593\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u306a\u3069\u3001\u591a\u5f69\u306a\u4f53\u9a13\u3092\u304a\u697d\u3057\u307f\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002", "short_description": "\u3053\u306e\u90e8\u5c4b\u306b\u306f\u3001\u30e6\u30cb\u30fc\u30af\u306aVR\u4f53\u9a13\u3092\u697d\u3057\u3081\u308b\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u4ed5\u639b\u3051\u304c\u7528\u610f\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5ba4\u5185\u306e\u30c7\u30b9\u30af\u306b\u7f6e\u304b\u308c\u305f\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3084\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u53c2\u8003\u306b\u3001\u305c\u3072\u4f53\u9a13\u3057\u3066\u307f\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tatsu-studio/%E3%83%9B%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "tatsuo studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tatsu-studio/%E3%83%9B%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfo